dict(id='R08', act=1, set='farm15', vis='Night. Bill rides off down a muddy road and the wagon lantern shrinks to a dot. Eliza holds the door. John, about ten, stands in front of the younger children.',
  lines=[('N', "Then, in the 1850s, after he was accused of a serious crime, Bill drifted away for good. Years later he took a fake name, Doctor William Levingston, and quietly married another woman, while still married to Eliza. He kept that double life for decades."),
         ('N', "So young John grew up as the man of the house. And he learned two things. Never depend on anyone. And trust only what you can count.")]),
