dict(id='R33', act=7, set='lamps15', vis='Montage: a dark poor kitchen lights up with a cheap kerosene lamp. Blue tins on a ship to Asia. Price tag on a lamp oil can drops: 26c... 15c... 8c. Families reading at night.',
  lines=[('N', "And here's the twist that makes him hard to judge. All that efficiency made kerosene much cheaper. A gallon fell from around twenty six cents in 1870 to about eight cents by the mid 1880s. For millions of ordinary families, the night got longer. They could read, sew and study after dark."),
         ('N', "Standard sold its oil around the world, from Europe to China, even selling cheap little lamps so people would keep buying the fuel. Sell the lamp cheap, sell the oil forever.")]),
